# ── Media — LOCAL ONLY, never commit ──────────────────────────────────────────
# All image, audio, and video files under assets/clients/ are local dev assets.
# In production these are served from Firebase Storage / CDN.
# Drop files here freely — they will never be staged or pushed to GitHub.
assets/clients/**/*.png
assets/clients/**/*.jpg
assets/clients/**/*.jpeg
assets/clients/**/*.gif
assets/clients/**/*.webp
assets/clients/**/*.mp4
assets/clients/**/*.mov
assets/clients/**/*.avi
assets/clients/**/*.mp3
assets/clients/**/*.wav
assets/clients/**/*.aac
assets/clients/**/*.m4a
